  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Identify the correct order of reactivity for the following pairs towards the respective mechanism</p><p>(A)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/844e701c-5bda-4bb6-ae13-c5e45cf238ed.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 84px;\" /></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/53a278f5-e816-4127-97c4-b450793584e3.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 121px;\" /></p><p>(C)&nbsp;Electrophilic substitution</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7e5153f1-9942-445f-8eae-5ca54803b3e1.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 185px;\" /></p><p>(D)&nbsp;Nucleophilic substitution</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ecb7da47-4e07-4837-9588-91d2b43d80fa.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Choose the correction answer from the options given below:</p>",
